    <briefdescription>
<para>The textures bound to the targets for one execution. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every declared target is bound exactly once, except a vrs target Pass::vrsEnabled() rejects, and a clear value is given exactly for the targets the plan clears. Names are kept by pointer until <ref refid="namespaceShaderRenderPass_1acaf7d4214bb4badf5930384a748815a5" kindref="member">begin()</ref>. A sampled_depth target gets only its read-only depth bind here; the caller binds the same texture to the register the shader samples. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
